+# F03 six-host integration — 2026-11-03
+
+Status: **pending**. Requirement: Windows, GTK, Android, macOS, iPhone and iPad
+share nested shelves, tags, series, group delete/restore, membership remove/restore,
+and retain consistent organization after actual process restart.
+
+The user authorized the necessary operations in this chat on 2026-11-03.
+Integration branch: `codex/f03-six-host-20261103`. Product baseline:
+`054df69524eed483759febdcc0ce20e634921f82`. SDK: 3.42.0,
+`8357eafa28423a7ab93ba08b823af80f01ad1505`; the five SDK paths have identical Git objects.
+The SDK repository default branch is not the reader composition baseline.
+
+## Frozen production Git blob IDs (SHA-1)
+
+- `apps/reader/desktop/windows_records_owner.cpp`: `fb1b36b8ee6a0c48b81d8aff3b2097c7372c4b33`
+- `examples/android/app/src/main/java/org/exreader/host/ReadingParserPolicy.java`: `9566f21b7f38c3652d9a416cabd73d1b76a959d6`
+- `examples/apple/HostReadingRecords.swift`: `2c6185723fb523996b7c86ec5caf25f849a3f8cf`
+
+These complete values come from the original fixed scope at baseline, and match
+the baseline tree. Every new native job verifies them; no SDK edit is planned.
+
+## Reviewed reuse
+
+The two Apple receive files are byte-identical between the older `94fb236a` and
+the current product baseline. Adopt the sealed two-file organization projection
+delta from `0fa23868a585c6a7698e05ea25a835f279063c8a`; it uses existing public
+bounded projection, preserves cancellation/account fencing, and surfaces unresolved
+dependencies and unsafe heads. Reuse its Windows receiver and XCTest receiver.
+No old test assertion or historical result is rewritten.
+
+Original job `124448286050` in run `41170540560/1` confirms six organization tests
+with one failure: iPad `testTagAndSeriesPersist`, `Missing organization.kind.tag`.
+Its failure hierarchy shows the library screen with no organization sheet.
+The cause still requires current-source execution. Original Android owner run
+`41333466356/1` is failed; run `41588932707/1` passes only the Android acceptance.
+
+## First integration round
+
+Run the new source's GTK build/original organization suite and six-phase native
+author, Windows 3.42 composed build/retained checks, and all three Apple targets'
+unchanged original six organization tests. Caps: GTK 60, Windows 90, Apple
+60 per target: at most 330 runner-minutes, no automatic reruns. Stop each job
+on its first mandatory failure and retain the evidence. This is an integration
+diagnostic round, not a six-host acceptance and not a reuse of any old CI budget.
+
+The final round must additionally execute all six actual receiver paths for all
+six phases, Android's retained chain, verify immutable wire/DB/UI/program identity,
+authenticate current-run artifacts, and reject negative controls. Until that
+complete evidence exists F03 stays pending and receives no formal count credit.
